## File structure

```
pdf-ai-bot/
    bot/        → Telegram bot (Telegraf)
    api/        → backend orchestration (Express/Fastify)
    workers/    → BullMQ background processors

  packages/
    shared/     → types, utils, chunking, logging
    ai/         → OpenAI + Gemini abstraction layer
    pdf/        → PDF extraction utilities
    storage/    → S3/R2 file handling
    db/         → MongoDB (Mongoose)

  infra/
    docker/

```

